ís desde el portafolio?</p><p class=\"mt-1 text-sm text-ink-muted\">Probá una barbería de prueba con datos ya cargados, sin crear una cuenta.</p><a class=\"inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-md font-medium transition-colors disabled:cursor-not-allowed disabled:opacity-50 border border-line-strong bg-surface text-ink hover:bg-surface-muted min-h-9 px-3 text-sm mt-3\" href=\"/demo\">Abrir la demo</a></div><div class=\"mt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-sm font-semibold\">Horarios de atención</h2><div class=\"mt-3 space-y-2\"><div class=\"space-y-3 p-4 sm:p-5\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"><span class=\"sr-only\">Cargando...</span><div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"animate-pulse rounded-md bg-surface-muted h-16 w-full\"></div><div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"animate-pulse rounded-md bg-surface-muted h-16 w-full\"></div></div></div></div></div><section class=\"rounded-panel border border-line bg-surface\"><header class=\"flex flex-wrap items-start justify-between gap-3 border-b border-line px-4 py-4 sm:px-5\"><div><h2 class=\"text-base font-semibold\">Servicios</h2><p class=\"mt-1 text-sm text-ink-muted\">Precios y duración reales del catálogo.</p></div></header><div class=\"space-y-3 p-4 sm:p-5\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"><span class=\"sr-only\">Cargando...</span><div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"animate-pulse rounded-md bg-surface-muted h-16 w-full\"></div><div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"animate-pulse rounded-md bg-surface-muted h-16 w-full\"></div><div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"animate-pulse rounded-md bg-surface-muted h-16 w-full\"></div></div></section></section></div><!--$--><!--/$--><!--/$--></div></main><footer class=\"border-t border-line bg-surface\"><div class=\"mx-auto max-w-6xl px-4 py-6 text-sm text-ink-muted sm:px-6 lg:px-8\">BarberApp<!-- --> · Reservas online</div></footer></div><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/310vm2bl3xxpt.js\" id=\"_R_\" async=\"\"></script><script>(self.__next_f=self.__next_f||[]).push([0])</script